icky Pyer, 1921"}],"photos":[{"f":"crops/B148/B148-p02-1924-group.jpg","c":"1924 CAN YOU NAME THE BLANKS? Standing: (Left to Right) Charlie Bain, ------, Wally Bayliss, Ken O'Kell, A.E.Smith, Mick Pyer, ------,H. J. Coxhead,Bert Footer, Syd King, Harry Parker Seated:(Left to Right) ------, ------, F. L. Buckingham,Frank Thomson,Harry 'Spider' Bruce,Jimmy Flatt, Arthur Lamm, ------,------.","id":"B148-02","w":"November 1962"},{"f":"crops/B160/B160-p35-club-10-start-1926.jpg","c":"This is thought to be the start of the Club '10' of 1926. Of the 11 starters, 9 finished. Winner was the smartly turned-out Bert Footer. (3rd from right) alongside of whom is the bespectacled Wally Bayliss who was to become our President, but probably retired from this race. Runner up to Footer was Micky Pyer (extreme left) who won in 1923 and 1924; with George Still (extreme right) 3rd. A.E. Smith (second from left) was 5th and J.G. Flatt (fourth from left) 6th.","id":"B160-67","w":"December 1966"},{"f":"crops/B165/B165-p06-opening-run-1923.jpg","c":"","id":"B165-08","w":"March 1968"},{"f":"crops/B173/B173-p32-surrey-championship-1926-epsom-start.jpg","c":"Labels on photo: A.E.SMITH, G.F.EASTON, J.G.FLATT, W.A.RICE, A.D.PYER, H.W.BRUCE, J.D.ANDREWS, W.H.WILLIAMS, K.B.O'KELL, H.E.FOOTER. Caption (page 33): The start of the 1926 Surrey County Championship at Epsom Downs","id":"B173-76","w":"March 1970"},{"f":"crops/B217/B217-p04-pyer-1926.jpg","c":"Micky Pyer (extreme left) lines up at the start of the Belgrave 10 mile C.C. Championship in 1926. Having won the title in 1923 and 1924, this time he had to give way to his captain Bert Footer.\nLeft to right: A.D.Pyer, A.E.Smith, -, J.G.Flatt, -, -, -, -, H.E.Footer, W.L.Bayliss, G.Still.","id":"B217-15","w":"December 1991"}],"photo":{"file":"crops/B148/B148-p02-1924-group.jpg","caption":"1924 CAN YOU NAME THE BLANKS? Standing: (Left to Right) Charlie Bain, ------, Wally Bayliss, Ken O'Kell, A.E.Smith, Mick Pyer, ------,H. J. Coxhead,Bert Footer,